message: >-
  If you use this collection, cite the relevant skill and the original
  methods and sources identified in that skill's NOTICE.md.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Self-contained research skills for coding agents, covering computational
  protein design, paper planning and evidence tracking, editable scientific
  illustrations, and native PowerPoint scientific figures. Each skill includes
  its own workflow, dependencies, attribution, and validation scope.
